TuiVision - License and Project Notice
======================================

Project intent and non-affiliation notice
-----------------------------------------
TuiVision is an educational example project that demonstrates how Turbo Vision
concepts can be modernized with C#/.NET 10 using Agentic-AI workflows.

This project is not an official Turbo Vision continuation, is not affiliated
with Turbo Vision rightsholders, and is not intended to compete with Turbo
Vision.

The project does not intend to violate licenses or rights of Turbo Vision or
other third-party sources.

